{"id": "fe4f95e2-3a5f-4f32-bd5f-a24c692e52e8", "slug": "vertex-command-surface", "title": "Vertex - Command Surface", "description": "Vertex Command Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Vertex - Command Surface\"\ndescription: \"Vertex Command Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F4C76B\"\n  secondary: \"#7DD3FC\"\n  accent: \"#7DD3FC\"\n  background: \"#DDE8F2\"\n  surface: \"#94A3B8\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"IBM Plex Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Space Grotesk\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"IBM Plex Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Vertex - Command Surface\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 30; favorites: 3; remixes: 0.\nTags: button, animated, dither, action, effect, cta.\n## Overview\nVertex Command Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nVertex Metrics Systems Activate Sync Sequence Beta Active Deploying secure network protocols. Initiate Scan Read Logs\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Deploying secure network protocols..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F4C76B, secondary #7DD3FC, accent #7DD3FC, background #DDE8F2, surface #94A3B8, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse IBM Plex Mono for display moments and Space Grotesk for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use IBM Plex Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased dark\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus - Polar Command Surface</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script type=\"importmap\">\n        {\n            \"imports\": {\n                \"three\": \"https://unpkg.com/three@0.160.0/build/three.module.js\",\n                \"postprocessing\": \"https://unpkg.com/postprocessing@6.34.1/build/index.js\",\n                \"gsap\": \"https://unpkg.com/gsap@3.12.5/index.js\"\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n    <style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap');\n\n        :root {\n            --void: #05070B;\n            --graphite: #0B111A;\n            --panel: rgba(13, 21, 32, 0.82);\n            --panel-strong: rgba(17, 26, 38, 0.94);\n            --frost: #F3F7FA;\n            --starlight: #DDE8F2;\n            --steel: #9AA8B8;\n            --muted: #64748B;\n            --cyan: #7DD3FC;\n            --cyan-hot: #38BDF8;\n            --amber: #F4C76B;\n            --border: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);\n        }\n\n        * {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            background:\n                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 32%, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1), transparent 32%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 78% 18%, rgba(244, 199, 107, 0.075), transparent 28%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 18% 72%, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.06), transparent 30%),\n                var(--void);\n            color: var(--steel);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        body::before {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: fixed;\n            inset: 0;\n            z-index: 2;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            background:\n                linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.035), transparent 20%, transparent 80%, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.025)),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, transparent 38%, rgba(5, 7, 11, 0.72) 100%);\n        }\n\n        .dither-overlay {\n            background-image: url(\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 4 4' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cpath d='M1 1h1v1H1zM3 1h1v1H3zM0 3h1v1H0zM2 3h1v1H2z' fill='%23ffffff' fill-opacity='0.045'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\");\n            background-size: 4px 4px;\n            background-repeat: repeat;\n            mix-blend-mode: screen;\n            opacity: 0.52;\n        }\n\n        .ambient-field {\n            position: fixed;\n            inset: -20%;\n            z-index: 1;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            background:\n                linear-gradient(115deg, transparent 0 32%, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.055) 44%, transparent 56% 100%),\n                linear-gradient(75deg, transparent 0 42%, rgba(244, 199, 107, 0.035) 48%, transparent 58% 100%);\n            filter: blur(18px);\n            opacity: 0.75;\n            animation: polarDrift 14s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n        }\n\n        .shell-border {\n            padding: 1px;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            background:\n                linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.62), rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12) 34%, rgba(244, 199, 107, 0.48) 100%);\n            box-shadow:\n                0 24px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.42),\n                0 0 44px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08);\n        }\n\n        .glass-panel {\n            border-radius: 11px;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.055);\n            background:\n                linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(17, 26, 38, 0.92), rgba(8, 13, 21, 0.88));\n            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n        }\n\n        .mono {\n            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\n        }\n\n        .nav-link {\n            position: relative;\n            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            letter-spacing: 0.13em;\n            color: rgba(221, 232, 242, 0.62);\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            transition: color 0.25s ease;\n        }\n\n        .nav-link::after {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: -6px;\n            height: 1px;\n            transform: scaleX(0);\n            transform-origin: left;\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--cyan), transparent);\n            transition: transform 0.28s ease;\n        }\n\n        .nav-link:hover {\n            color: var(--frost);\n        }\n\n        .nav-link:hover::after {\n            transform: scaleX(1);\n        }\n\n        .status-dot {\n            width: 7px;\n            height: 7px;\n            border-radius: 999px;\n            background: var(--amber);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(244, 199, 107, 0.78);\n        }\n\n        .command-pill {\n            box-shadow:\n                0 18px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.36),\n                inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n        }\n\n        .headline-line {\n            position: relative;\n            display: block;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            padding: 0.02em 0 0.08em;\n            perspective: 800px;\n        }\n\n        .reveal-text {\n            display: inline-block;\n            transform-origin: 50% 100%;\n            will-change: transform, filter, opacity, letter-spacing;\n        }\n\n        .signal-scan {\n            position: absolute;\n            left: 0;\n            bottom: 0.08em;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 1px;\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.92), rgba(244, 199, 107, 0.68), transparent);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.42);\n            opacity: 0.88;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        .primary-action {\n            background:\n                linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(244, 199, 107, 0.16), rgba(244, 199, 107, 0.06)),\n                rgba(9, 14, 22, 0.94);\n            color: var(--frost);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(244, 199, 107, 0.34);\n            box-shadow: 0 0 34px rgba(244, 199, 107, 0.08);\n        }\n\n        .primary-action:hover {\n            border-color: rgba(244, 199, 107, 0.72);\n            background:\n                linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(244, 199, 107, 0.24), rgba(244, 199, 107, 0.09)),\n                rgba(13, 18, 25, 0.98);\n        }\n\n        .secondary-action {\n            background: rgba(8, 13, 21, 0.72);\n            color: rgba(221, 232, 242, 0.74);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.18);\n        }\n\n        .secondary-action:hover {\n            color: var(--frost);\n            border-color: rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.42);\n            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.84);\n        }\n\n        .micro-data {\n            font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\n            color: rgba(221, 232, 242, 0.52);\n            letter-spacing: 0.13em;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n        }\n\n        .micro-data b {\n            color: var(--cyan);\n            font-weight: 500;\n        }\n\n        ::selection {\n            background-color: rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.2);\n            color: var(--frost);\n        }\n\n        @keyframes polarDrift {\n            from {\n                transform: translate3d(-1.5%, -1%, 0) rotate(-1deg);\n            }\n            to {\n                transform: translate3d(1.5%, 1%, 0) rotate(1deg);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Container -->\n    <div id=\"canvas-container\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-[#05070B]\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Atmospheric Layers -->\n    <div class=\"ambient-field\"></div>\n    <div class=\"dither-overlay fixed inset-0 z-[3] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- UI Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full h-screen flex flex-col pointer-events-none\">\n\n        <!-- Navigation -->\n        <div class=\"fixed top-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[90%] max-w-5xl z-50 pointer-events-auto opacity-0 ui-element\">\n            <div class=\"shell-border\">\n                <nav class=\"glass-panel flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-3.5\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[#F3F7FA]\">\n                        <div class=\"grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-[8px] border border-sky-300/20 bg-sky-300/10 shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(56,189,248,0.12)]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:radar-bold-duotone\" class=\"text-sky-300 text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"leading-none\">\n                            <span class=\"block text-xl font-medium tracking-[-0.04em]\">Nexus</span>\n                            <span class=\"mono mt-1 block text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-slate-400\">Polar Command</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-9\">\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-link\">Telemetry</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-link\">Nodes</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-link\">Archives</a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <button class=\"mono group flex items-center gap-2 rounded-[8px] border border-amber-300/25 bg-amber-300/10 px-4 py-2 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-amber-200 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-amber-200/50 hover:bg-amber-300/15 hover:text-amber-100\">\n                        <span class=\"status-dot\"></span>\n                        Initialize\n                    </button>\n                </nav>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Main Content -->\n        <main class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 relative z-10 pointer-events-auto\">\n\n            <!-- Pill -->\n            <div class=\"hero-element mb-8 opacity-0\">\n                <div class=\"shell-border command-pill\">\n                    <div class=\"glass-panel inline-flex items-center gap-3 py-2 pl-2.5 pr-5\">\n                        <span class=\"mono flex items-center gap-2 rounded-[7px] border border-amber-300/25 bg-amber-300/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.14em] text-amber-200 uppercase\">\n                            <span class=\"status-dot\"></span>\n                            Live\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"mono text-[11px] font-normal text-slate-300 tracking-[0.15em] uppercase\">Aurora Link Calibrated</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Headline -->\n<!-- Headline -->\n<h1 class=\"text-center text-[clamp(3.2rem,7.4vw,7.4rem)] leading-[0.94] font-[300] tracking-[-0.055em] text-[#F3F7FA] mx-auto flex flex-col items-center gap-3\">\n    <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-2\">\n        <span class=\"reveal-text inline-block whitespace-nowrap\">Establishing secure</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-2\">\n        <span class=\"reveal-text inline-block whitespace-nowrap text-white\">uplink protocols.</span>\n    </div>\n</h1>\n\n            <!-- CTAs -->\n            <div class=\"hero-element mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 opacity-0\">\n                <button class=\"primary-action mono w-full sm:w-auto rounded-[10px] px-8 py-4 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] transition-all duration-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-circle-bold-duotone\" class=\"text-lg text-amber-200\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Commence Scan\n                </button>\n\n                <button class=\"secondary-action mono w-full sm:w-auto rounded-[10px] px-8 py-4 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] transition-all duration-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-text-bold-duotone\" class=\"text-lg text-sky-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                    View Logs\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Micro Telemetry -->\n            <div class=\"hero-element micro-data mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-7 gap-y-3 text-[10px] opacity-0\">\n                <span>Signal <b>98.7%</b></span>\n                <span>Latency <b>12ms</b></span>\n                <span>Orbit <b>Stable</b></span>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <script type=\"module\">\n        import * as THREE from 'three';\n        import { BloomEffect, ChromaticAberrationEffect, EffectComposer, EffectPass, RenderPass } from 'postprocessing';\n        import { gsap } from 'gsap';\n\n        // --- Polar Command Interface Animation ---\n        function startInterfaceAnimation() {\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ delay: 0.18 });\n\n            gsap.set(\".signal-scan\", { scaleX: 0, transformOrigin: \"left center\" });\n            gsap.set(\".micro-data span\", { opacity: 0, y: 8 });\n\n            tl.fromTo(\".reveal-text\",\n                { opacity: 0, y: \"95%\", rotateX: 14, filter: \"blur(18px)\", letterSpacing: \"-0.085em\" },\n                { opacity: 1, y: \"0%\", rotateX: 0, filter: \"blur(0px)\", letterSpacing: \"-0.048em\", duration: 1.35, ease: \"expo.out\", stagger: 0.16 }\n            )\n            .to(\".signal-scan\",\n                { scaleX: 1, duration: 0.72, ease: \"power2.out\", stagger: 0.12 },\n                \"-=1.12\"\n            )\n            .to(\".signal-scan\",\n                { xPercent: 110, opacity: 0, duration: 0.72, ease: \"power2.in\", stagger: 0.12 },\n                \"-=0.36\"\n            )\n            .fromTo(\".hero-element\",\n                { opacity: 0, y: 22, scale: 0.985, filter: \"blur(12px)\" },\n                { opacity: 1, y: 0, scale: 1, filter: \"blur(0px)\", duration: 1.05, ease: \"power3.out\", stagger: 0.1 },\n                \"-=0.76\"\n            )\n            .fromTo(\".ui-element\",\n                { opacity: 0, y: -10, filter: \"blur(10px)\" },\n                { opacity: 1, y: 0, filter: \"blur(0px)\", duration: 1.1, ease: \"power2.out\" },\n                \"-=0.92\"\n            )\n            .to(\".micro-data span\",\n                { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 0.72, ease: \"power2.out\", stagger: 0.08 },\n                \"-=0.68\"\n            );\n        }\n\n        // --- WebGL Polar GridScan Setup ---\n        const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');\n        if (!container) console.error(\"Canvas container not found\");\n\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: false, alpha: true, powerPreference: \"high-performance\" });\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        renderer.outputColorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;\n        renderer.toneMapping = THREE.NoToneMapping;\n        renderer.autoClear = false;\n        container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n        const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n\n        const vert = `\n        varying vec2 vUv;\n        void main(){\n            vUv = uv;\n            gl_Position = vec4(position.xy, 0.0, 1.0);\n        }\n        `;\n\n        const frag = `\n        precision highp float;\n        uniform vec3 iResolution;\n        uniform float iTime;\n        uniform vec2 uSkew;\n        uniform float uTilt;\n        uniform float uYaw;\n        uniform float uLineThickness;\n        uniform vec3 uLinesColor;\n        uniform vec3 uScanColor;\n        uniform float uGridScale;\n        uniform float uLineStyle;\n        uniform float uLineJitter;\n        uniform float uScanOpacity;\n        uniform float uScanDirection;\n        uniform float uNoise;\n        uniform float uBloomOpacity;\n        uniform float uScanGlow;\n        uniform float uScanSoftness;\n        uniform float uPhaseTaper;\n        uniform float uScanDuration;\n        uniform float uScanDelay;\n        varying vec2 vUv;\n\n        uniform float uScanStarts[8];\n        uniform float uScanCount;\n\n        const int MAX_SCANS = 8;\n\n        float smoother01(float a, float b, float x){\n            float t = clamp((x - a) / max(1e-5, (b - a)), 0.0, 1.0);\n            return t * t * t * (t * (t * 6.0 - 15.0) + 10.0);\n        }\n\n        void mainImage(out vec4 fragColor, in vec2 fragCoord)\n        {\n            vec2 p = (2.0 * fragCoord - iResolution.xy) / iResolution.y;\n\n            vec3 ro = vec3(0.0);\n            vec3 rd = normalize(vec3(p, 2.0));\n\n            float cR = cos(uTilt), sR = sin(uTilt);\n            rd.xy = mat2(cR, -sR, sR, cR) * rd.xy;\n\n            float cY = cos(uYaw), sY = sin(uYaw);\n            rd.xz = mat2(cY, -sY, sY, cY) * rd.xz;\n\n            vec2 skew = clamp(uSkew, vec2(-0.7), vec2(0.7));\n            rd.xy += skew * rd.z;\n\n            vec3 color = vec3(0.0);\n            float minT = 1e20;\n            float gridScale = max(1e-5, uGridScale);\n            float fadeStrength = 2.5;\n            vec2 gridUV = vec2(0.0);\n\n            float hitIsY = 1.0;\n            for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++)\n            {\n                float isY = float(i < 2);\n                float pos = mix(-0.2, 0.2, float(i)) * isY + mix(-0.5, 0.5, float(i - 2)) * (1.0 - isY);\n                float num = pos - (isY * ro.y + (1.0 - isY) * ro.x);\n                float den = isY * rd.y + (1.0 - isY) * rd.x;\n                float t = num / den;\n                vec3 h = ro + rd * t;\n\n                float depthBoost = smoothstep(0.0, 3.0, h.z);\n                h.xy += skew * 0.15 * depthBoost;\n\n                bool use = t > 0.0 && t < minT;\n                gridUV = use ? mix(h.zy, h.xz, isY) / gridScale : gridUV;\n                minT = use ? t : minT;\n                hitIsY = use ? isY : hitIsY;\n            }\n\n            vec3 hit = ro + rd * minT;\n            float dist = length(hit - ro);\n\n            float jitterAmt = clamp(uLineJitter, 0.0, 1.0);\n            if (jitterAmt > 0.0) {\n                vec2 j = vec2(\n                    sin(gridUV.y * 2.7 + iTime * 1.8),\n                    cos(gridUV.x * 2.3 - iTime * 1.6)\n                ) * (0.15 * jitterAmt);\n                gridUV += j;\n            }\n            float fx = fract(gridUV.x);\n            float fy = fract(gridUV.y);\n            float ax = min(fx, 1.0 - fx);\n            float ay = min(fy, 1.0 - fy);\n            float wx = fwidth(gridUV.x);\n            float wy = fwidth(gridUV.y);\n            float halfPx = max(0.0, uLineThickness) * 0.5;\n\n            float tx = halfPx * wx;\n            float ty = halfPx * wy;\n\n            float aax = wx;\n            float aay = wy;\n\n            float lineX = 1.0 - smoothstep(tx, tx + aax, ax);\n            float lineY = 1.0 - smoothstep(ty, ty + aay, ay);\n\n            // Force dot matrix pattern based on uLineStyle logic\n            if (uLineStyle > 0.5) {\n                float dashRepeat = 4.0;\n                float dashDuty = 0.5;\n                float vy = fract(gridUV.y * dashRepeat);\n                float vx = fract(gridUV.x * dashRepeat);\n                float dashMaskY = step(vy, dashDuty);\n                float dashMaskX = step(vx, dashDuty);\n                if (uLineStyle < 1.5) {\n                    lineX *= dashMaskY;\n                    lineY *= dashMaskX;\n                } else {\n                    float dotRepeat = 8.0;\n                    float dotWidth = 0.12;\n                    float cy = abs(fract(gridUV.y * dotRepeat) - 0.5);\n                    float cx = abs(fract(gridUV.x * dotRepeat) - 0.5);\n                    float dotMaskY = 1.0 - smoothstep(dotWidth, dotWidth + fwidth(gridUV.y * dotRepeat), cy);\n                    float dotMaskX = 1.0 - smoothstep(dotWidth, dotWidth + fwidth(gridUV.x * dotRepeat), cx);\n                    lineX *= dotMaskY;\n                    lineY *= dotMaskX;\n                }\n            }\n            float primaryMask = max(lineX, lineY);\n\n            vec2 gridUV2 = (hitIsY > 0.5 ? hit.xz : hit.zy) / gridScale;\n            if (jitterAmt > 0.0) {\n                vec2 j2 = vec2(\n                    cos(gridUV2.y * 2.1 - iTime * 1.4),\n                    sin(gridUV2.x * 2.5 + iTime * 1.7)\n                ) * (0.15 * jitterAmt);\n                gridUV2 += j2;\n            }\n            float fx2 = fract(gridUV2.x);\n            float fy2 = fract(gridUV2.y);\n            float ax2 = min(fx2, 1.0 - fx2);\n            float ay2 = min(fy2, 1.0 - fy2);\n            float wx2 = fwidth(gridUV2.x);\n            float wy2 = fwidth(gridUV2.y);\n            float tx2 = halfPx * wx2;\n            float ty2 = halfPx * wy2;\n            float aax2 = wx2;\n            float aay2 = wy2;\n            float lineX2 = 1.0 - smoothstep(tx2, tx2 + aax2, ax2);\n            float lineY2 = 1.0 - smoothstep(ty2, ty2 + aay2, ay2);\n            if (uLineStyle > 0.5) {\n                float dashRepeat2 = 4.0;\n                float dashDuty2 = 0.5;\n                float vy2m = fract(gridUV2.y * dashRepeat2);\n                float vx2m = fract(gridUV2.x * dashRepeat2);\n                float dashMaskY2 = step(vy2m, dashDuty2);\n                float dashMaskX2 = step(vx2m, dashDuty2);\n                if (uLineStyle < 1.5) {\n                    lineX2 *= dashMaskY2;\n                    lineY2 *= dashMaskX2;\n                } else {\n                    float dotRepeat2 = 8.0;\n                    float dotWidth2 = 0.12;\n                    float cy2 = abs(fract(gridUV2.y * dotRepeat2) - 0.5);\n                    float cx2 = abs(fract(gridUV2.x * dotRepeat2) - 0.5);\n                    float dotMaskY2 = 1.0 - smoothstep(dotWidth2, dotWidth2 + fwidth(gridUV2.y * dotRepeat2), cy2);\n                    float dotMaskX2 = 1.0 - smoothstep(dotWidth2, dotWidth2 + fwidth(gridUV2.x * dotRepeat2), cx2);\n                    lineX2 *= dotMaskY2;\n                    lineY2 *= dotMaskX2;\n                }\n            }\n            float altMask = max(lineX2, lineY2);\n\n            float edgeDistX = min(abs(hit.x - (-0.5)), abs(hit.x - 0.5));\n            float edgeDistY = min(abs(hit.y - (-0.2)), abs(hit.y - 0.2));\n            float edgeDist = mix(edgeDistY, edgeDistX, hitIsY);\n            float edgeGate = 1.0 - smoothstep(gridScale * 0.5, gridScale * 2.0, edgeDist);\n            altMask *= edgeGate;\n\n            float lineMask = max(primaryMask, altMask);\n\n            float fade = exp(-dist * fadeStrength);\n\n            float dur = max(0.05, uScanDuration);\n            float del = max(0.0, uScanDelay);\n            float scanZMax = 2.0;\n            float widthScale = max(0.1, uScanGlow);\n            float sigma = max(0.001, 0.18 * widthScale * uScanSoftness);\n            float sigmaA = sigma * 2.5; // Wider aura for atmospheric haze\n\n            float combinedPulse = 0.0;\n            float combinedAura = 0.0;\n\n            float cycle = dur + del;\n            float tCycle = mod(iTime, cycle);\n            float 